<itemSchema><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Low-top lace-up casual walking shoes with loop eyelets and visible panel seams. Color options: Black, Dark Grey, Brown. Confirmed EU size labels 36-48; confirm the size chart and fit before ordering. Send your color and size mix, pair quantity, packaging requirements and destination for a quotation. Material composition, availability, final price and dispatch timing are confirmed for each order. Sample availability and customization feasibility require review before confirmation.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Company images show general company-level development, production, checking and order coordination activities. Product-specific specifications, availability and services are confirmed after receiving your order requirements.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes can I enquire about?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Color options include Black, Dark Grey, Brown, with confirmed EU size labels 36-48. Confirm the size chart, fit and availability for your requested mix before ordering; US sizing is not inferred from the EU labels.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What information is needed for a quotation?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send the color and size mix, pair quantity, packaging requirements and destination. Listed prices are product references; freight, applicable taxes and additional order services are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which specifications should be confirmed before an order?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Confirm the requested s